## Compaction Triggers

### When Compaction Occurs

| Trigger | Condition | Effect |
|---------|-----------|--------|
| **Context 80% full** | ~100K of 128K tokens | Begin summarizing oldest messages |
| **Context 95% full** | ~120K of 128K tokens | Aggressive compaction |
| **Manual compaction** | User request | Force summarize conversation |
| **Message count limit** | ~100 messages in history | Summarize regardless of token count |

### Compaction Behavior

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Context near capacity] --> B{@-references present?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Preserve @-referenced content]
    B -->|No| D[Full compaction]
    
    C --> E[Summarize non-@ messages]
    D --> F[Summarize all messages]
    
    E --> G[Create summary of removed content]
    F --> G
    
    G --> H{Summary quality?}
    H -->|Good| I[Keep summary + preserved context]
    H -->|Poor| J[Ask user for manual review]
    
    I --> K[Agent continues with compacted context]
    J --> L[User provides key context manually]
    L --> K
```

### What Gets Summarized

| Content Type | Compaction Action |
|-------------|------------------|
| **User messages** | Summarized into key points |
| **Agent tool calls** | Summarized (removed individual calls) |
| **Agent tool results** | Summarized into key findings |
| **Agent final responses** | Preserved verbatim (important) |
| **Code snippets in messages** | Summarized or removed |
| **@-references** | Preserved verbatim |
| **Error messages** | Preserved if actionable |

### What Gets Preserved

| Content | Why Preserved |
|---------|--------------|
| **@-references** | Explicit user inclusion |
| **Recent messages** | High recency score |
| **Error messages** | Actionable for agent |
| **User constraints** | Important for context |
| **Decisions made** | For continuity |
| **Code snippets in @-references** | Explicitly included |

