## Context Window Settings

### Configuration Options

```json
{
  // Primary context window size
  "cursor.agent.contextWindow": 128000,
  
  // Tab completion context window (separate)
  "cursor.agent.tabContextWindow": 8192,
  
  // Maximum tokens per response
  "cursor.agent.maxTokens": 4096,
  
  // Context retention policy
  "cursor.agent.contextRetention": "balanced",
  
  // Enable/disable auto-compaction
  "cursor.agent.autoCompaction": true,
  
  // Minimum messages before compaction
  "cursor.agent.compactionMinMessages": 50,
  
  // Compact when context exceeds percentage
  "cursor.agent.compactionThreshold": 0.80
}
```

### Context Retention Policies

| Policy | Behavior | Best For |
|--------|----------|----------|
| `"minimal"` | Aggressive compaction, fewer messages retained | Long conversations, quick responses |
| `"balanced"` | Moderate compaction, preserves key context | Most workflows (default) |
| `"full"` | Minimal compaction, retains more context | Complex multi-step tasks |

